    "message": "Check the research psychology default on the shared generated Scenario\n\nFive tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder (10\nevacuees, seed 7) to check the generated psychology model. They now use\nthe shared generated_scenario fixture (#88).\n\nThe file mixed scopes, so it is split: model selection stays as unit\ntests of the policy registry, the run moves to\ntests/integration/test_research_psychology.py, the CLI warning for a\nlegacy model to tests/e2e/test_legacy_psychology_cli.py, and the\ncomparison report check to tests/unit/experiments/test_comparison.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
